        "created_at": "2014-03-23T12:12:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Haha cool, I can imagine Knyfe standing amid a pile of broken limbs, similar to the way she's standing surrounded by corpses in Flawless Execution's art, looking all \"Yeah, did I mention it's a bad idea to mess with me?\" while the other heroes stand to one side and...applaud or something, I suppose :D.</p>",
